SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Remove loader audit dispatch, including forged registrations
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [fixed Werewolf appliance policy]
Reference: https://github.com/werewolf-linux/werewolf/blob/main/docs/design/xzutils.md
Base-Commit: 34106fee698c83eb0af71d4d0381e66b399be746

Audit state is writable during relocation. Refusing registration does not
prevent an IFUNC resolver from forging it. Keep neutral internal entry
points, with no audit-state traversal or callback invocation. Preserve
normal symbol binding and CPU dispatch.

